IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BANKTRAN.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TRAN-ID PIC 9(7).
01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(7).
01 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(7) VALUE 50000.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "ENTER TRANSACTION ID: ".
    ACCEPT WS-TRAN-ID.

    DISPLAY "ENTER TRANSACTION AMOUNT: ".
    ACCEPT WS-AMOUNT.

    IF WS-AMOUNT > 0 AND WS-AMOUNT <= WS-BALANCE
        SUBTRACT WS-AMOUNT FROM WS-BALANCE

        DISPLAY "TRANSACTION SUCCESSFUL"
        DISPLAY "TRANSACTION ID: "
            FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TRAN-ID LEADING)
        DISPLAY "REMAINING BALANCE: "
            FUNCTION TRIM(WS-BALANCE LEADING)
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "TRANSACTION FAILED"
        DISPLAY "INSUFFICIENT BALANCE OR INVALID AMOUNT"
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
